    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9588" root="حول" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْلَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Motion,</i> or <i>removal,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَرُّكٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَوُّلٌ</span>,
accord. to different copies of the K, the former
being the reading in the TA,) and <i>change of state.</i>
(K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْلٌ</span>. And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَالَ عَلَى الفَرَسِ</span>,
of which it is the inf. n.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِيلَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْلٌ</span>, as meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُوَّةٌ</span>.

